- → 고속형 — 빠른 물리 속도 구간에서 오히려 상대 성적이 오름\n\n🛠 무리배치: 데님: 약함 (-1.6σ) / 한손몰림: 강함 (+2.0σ) / 무리트릴: 강함 (+2.7σ) / 겹계단: 보통 (+0.8σ)\n\n📝 요약\n- \"빠른 구간에서 오히려 힘이 나는 반사신경형 플레이어. 주무기는 트릴과 연타. 정배의 무리배치(무리트릴)를 잘 버티는 편. 동시치기는 뚜렷한 약점이다. 개인차에서는 스크래치와 견제스크에 강하고, 차지와 변속에 약하다.\"\n- 🏷 #트릴↑ #연타↑ #계단↑ #동시치기↓ #차지↓ #소프란↓ #배치↑ #견제↑ #고속형 #데님취약 #한손몰림내성 #무리트릴내성","tags":["#트릴↑","#연타↑","#계단↑","#동시치기↓","#차지↓","#소프란↓","#배치↑","#고속형","#데님취약","#한손몰림내성","#무리트릴내성","#견제↑"],"nCharts":58,"_v":"2026-08-07T15:36:03.558Z","i18n":{"ja":{"head":"高速地力型、同時押しが足枷、皿絡みは得意","report":"🎯 曲の属性 (本人平均比)\n- 得意: トリル(+8.1), 連打(+7.1), 階段(+6.4) — 地力系が総じて強い\n- 苦手: 同時押し(-10.7, 圧倒的)\n- 配置の軸: 配置：全体的に得意 (+1.2σ), 配置・リズムのうち高速反復のみ得意 (+3.2σ)\n\n🎲 個人差\n- チャージ：圧倒的な弱点 (-7.9) / 皿：得意 (+3.4) / ソフラン：圧倒的な弱点 (-7.8)\n- 皿の詳細: 皿絡み：得意 (+10.1) · ロール速度 低速 -4.1/中速 +0.5/高速 +4.6\n\n⚡ 速度\n- 物理速度(鍵盤): 低速 -8.7(ストリーム -1.2/トリル -24.7/連打 -0.2) · 中速 +3.9(ストリーム -0.9/トリル +11.2/連打 +1.5) · 高速 -0.1(ストリーム +2.0/トリル -2.2) · 超高速 +3.7(ストリーム -1.1/トリル +8.4)\n- → 高速型 — 速い物理速度帯でむしろ相対的に成績が上がる\n\n🛠 無理配置: デニム：苦手 (-1.6σ) / 片手寄り：得意 (+2.0σ) / 無理トリル：得意 (+2.7σ) / 二重階段：普通 (+0.8σ)\n\n📝 まとめ\n- \"速い地帯に入るとむしろ調子が上がる反射神経型、プレイヤー。主武器はトリルと連打。正規の無理配置(無理トリル)はよく耐える方。同時押しは明確な弱点。個人差では皿と皿絡みが得意で、チャージと変速が苦手。\"\n- 🏷 #トリル↑ #連打↑ #階段↑ #同時押し↓ #チャージ↓ #ソフラン↓ #配置↑ #皿絡み↑ #高速型 #デニム苦手 #片手寄り耐性 #無理トリル耐性"},"en":{"head":"High-speed reader, bottlenecked by Chords, strong at Scratch-Key","report":"🎯 Chart Types (vs personal avg)\n- Strong: Trills(+8.1), Jacks(+7.1), Stairs(+6.4) — solid across reading-skill types\n- Weak: Chords(-10.7, dominant)\n- Layout: Layout overall strong(+1.2σ), Fast loop alone strong(+3.2σ) within Layout & rhythm\n\n🎲 Individual Factors\n- Charge -7.9 dominant weakness / Scratch +3.4 strong / Soflan -7.8 dominant weakness\n- Scratch detail: Scratch-Key +10.1 strong · Roll speed Low -4.1/Mid +0.5/High +4.6\n\n⚡ Speed\n- Physical note speed: Low -8.7(Stream -1.2/Trill -24.7/Jack -0.2) · Mid +3.9(Stream -0.9/Trill +11.2/Jack +1.5) · High -0.1(Stream +2.0/Trill -2.2) · Hyper +3.7(Stream -1.1/Trill +8.4)\n- → High-speed — relative performance actually rises in faster sections\n\n🛠 Awkward layouts: Denim -1.6σ weak / One-sided +2.0σ strong / Awkward Trill +2.7σ strong / Double Stairs +0.8σ\n\n📝 Summary\n- \"A player who actually comes alive in fast sections — a reflex type. Main weapons are trills and jacks. Tends to hold up well against Awkward Trill layouts on normal. They struggle clearly with chords. Among individual-factor types, strong at scratch and scratch-key but weak at charge notes and tempo changes.\"\n- 🏷 #Trills↑ #Jacks↑ #Stairs↑ #Chords↓ #Charge↓ #Soflan↓ #Layout↑ #Scratch-Key↑ #High-Speed #DenimWeak #One-sidedResistant #AwkwardTrillResistant"}}},"dp":[],"sp":[{"song_id":41,"diff":3,"lamp":1,"ex_score":424,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T18:37:52.356+00:00"},{"song_id":63,"diff":3,"lamp":6,"ex_score":2118,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T18:37:52.356+00:00"},{"song_id":124,"diff":3,"lamp":6,"ex_score":1380,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T17:59:30.007+00:00"},{"song_id":166,"diff":3,"lamp":1,"ex_score":1027,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T17:59:30.007+00:00"},{"song_id":278,"diff":3,"lamp":5,"ex_score":1868,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T18:29:29.937+00:00"},{"song_id":372,"diff":3,"lamp":1,"ex_score":1677,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-17T16:14:29.023+00:00"},{"song_id":377,"diff":3,"lamp":5,"ex_score":2218,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-17T15:59:28.357+00:00"},{"song_id":395,"diff":3,"lamp":5,"ex_score":1837,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T18:15:05.131+00:00"},{"song_id":425,"diff":3,"lamp":5,"ex_score":1998,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T18:15:05.131+00:00"},{"song_id":448,"diff":3,"lamp":6,"ex_score":2443,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-17T15:29:27.362+00:00"},{"song_id":463,"diff":3,"lamp":1,"ex_score":1379,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-17T15:29:27.362+00:00"},{"song_id":483,"diff":3,"lamp":1,"ex_score":1714,"played_version":0,"date":"2026-07-18T18:29:29.937+00:00"},{"song_id":517,"diff"